# Runtime dependencies for the welo_inference container.
#
# Deliberately narrower than requirements.txt, which is the training/analysis
# environment (jupyter, matplotlib, seaborn) and has no place in a serving
# image. Compile the hash-pinned lock from this file:
#
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes requirements-runtime.in
#
# Dependabot raises the ranges here; recompiling produces the lock the image
# actually installs.
